<title>FINLAND: NOKIA ADR TRADES AT $68-3/4 IN NEW YORK.</title>
<headline>NOKIA ADR TRADES AT $68-3/4 IN NEW YORK.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nokia Oy's A share ADR opened up $0-1/8 at $69 but soon eased to $68-3/4 -- down $0-1/8 -- in New York on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The latter price corresponded to about 354.34 markka.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 235, news@reuters.fi</p>
</text>
